WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.500
Welcome back to the stream, everyone.

00:00:03.800 --> 00:00:07.000
Today we are building a neural network from scratch.

00:00:07.300 --> 00:00:10.500
First, let's look at how a single neuron works.

00:00:10.800 --> 00:00:14.000
It takes inputs, multiplies them by weights, and adds a bias.

00:00:14.300 --> 00:00:17.500
Then we apply an activation function to the result.

00:00:17.800 --> 00:00:21.000
Stack enough of these layers and the model starts to learn.

00:00:21.300 --> 00:00:24.500
Don't forget to drop your questions in the chat.

00:00:24.800 --> 00:00:28.000
Alright, let's write some code together.
